{"id":"bbdcd05a-9840-4930-a82b-18d76a38cb46","revision":0,"last_node_id":10,"last_link_id":9,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[0,-330],"size":[2140,270],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Arbor · Folder review (no model needed)\n\nFolders are a tree too. **Load Folder** reads Arbor's sample keyframes (`arbor:storyboard`, a folder per scene) — point it at the output of **arbor_qwen_storyboard** or any folder of folders and the structure comes back by itself.\n\n- Every subfolder becomes a branch, named after the folder (\"Arrival\", \"The village\" — the `0 · ` order prefix is dropped). The **Panel** shows them with thumbnails.\n- **Image Grid** turns the tree straight into a contact sheet, one labelled row per folder.\n- **List Item** `0` takes the first image of every folder (try `-1`, `0, 2` or `::2`) — flip through them in the **Compare Viewer**.\n- **Reshape Tree** *flip matrix* turns scenes × shots into shots × scenes: the second sheet compares shot 1 of every scene, then shot 2.\n\nPaths: `output/…` is ComfyUI's output folder, `arbor:…` Arbor's sample media, other relative paths are in input, absolute paths work too."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## Arbor · Folder review (no model needed)\n\nFolders are a tree too. **Load Folder** reads Arbor's sample keyframes (`arbor:storyboard`, a folder per scene) — point it at the output of **arbor_qwen_storyboard** or any folder of folders and the structure comes back by itself.\n\n- Every subfolder becomes a branch, named after the folder (\"Arrival\", \"The village\" — the `0 · ` order prefix is dropped). The **Panel** shows them with thumbnails.\n- **Image Grid** turns the tree straight into a contact sheet, one labelled row per folder.\n- **List Item** `0` takes the first image of every folder (try `-1`, `0, 2` or `::2`) — flip through them in the **Compare Viewer**.\n- **Reshape Tree** *flip matrix* turns scenes × shots into shots × scenes: th